			subtitle: "{ftbquests.chapter.side_quest_sculk_horde.quest4.subtitle}"
			tasks: [{
				consume_items: true
				id: "3B13FD37208A9153"
				item: {
					Count: 1b
					id: "minecraft:written_book"
					tag: {
						author: "bietongthuongko"
						filtered_title: "RESEARCH LOG NO.344"
						pages: [
							"{\"text\":\"    RESEARCH NO.344\\n-------------------\\n      SCULK SPORE\\n*About Sculk Spore:\\n-Sculk Spore, was a kind of plague hidden deep in the Deep Dark.\\nThese spores could survive in extreme conditions, such as human-inhabitable temperaure (sub-zero - 63 Celsius degrees)\\nin many years. Some\"}"
							"{\"text\":\"reports about that plague has likelihood with the mysterious creature in the Deep Dark called \\\"the Warden\\\".\\n-Transmit by: blood, lacerate pain, weak transmittion in water\\n-Symptom: rash skin, body fluid loss, cysts, mild photophobication,\\ninternal bleeding\\n-------------------\"}"
							"{\"text\":\"*Sculk Horde\\n Sculk Mite, was produced by infected body fluid. They are the main of the spread of Sculk Spore. By burrowing inside the host, they can reproducts and break host's cells, leading to the rapid death. Also, the spore can be transmit by Sculk Sprewer, which  \"}"
							"{\"text\":\"spread the disease into the air and water. With the Gravemind - Sculk brain, everything worse...\\n*Sculk Dvelopment States\\n-Underdeveloped stage:\\n First of all, bees are the first hosts for the plague, which carry spores to anywhere in the world \"}"
							"{\"text\":\"and infects every lives. After a host infects for a while, Sculk Mites breaks its cells and lacerate skin to escape, also cause body fluid loss. These body fluids will contains spores and periodically infects everything, turn them into infested state. Some types of infested plants will \"}"
							"{\"text\":\"take nutrients from infests block to grow, and all of them could spread a minor of spore to the air. If zombies infects spore, they will become a stronger versions of infector, due to Sculk Spore overwhelmed the Z Virus inside them. Also, some of creatures can attacks and infects \"}"
							"{\"text\":\"with their acid spit.\\n Sculk Phantoms, was a flying Sculk infector, have a(n) advantage of distance and sight. They also contributes of scouting and dash attacking for the horde. Sometime, they could dies and leave infected corpse and infects everything around.\\n-Immature stage:\\n\"}"
							"{\"text\":\" After Gravemind activated for a long time, they will enter immature state, with stronger infectors.\\n Sculk Creeper, with self-explosion ability, are the one of the most dangerous infectors. Their explosion could infects from a distance.\\n Sculk Vindicator, with their unique head, was \"}"
							"{\"text\":\"the main dangerous of the immature sculk disease. Also, Sculk Ravager was a infected version of Ravager, can deal a mass destructon in battle. Although they  are weaker than normal, dealing with this beast with just a handgun or melee weapons will be the suicidial.\"}"
							"{\"text\":\"If the Gravemind grows enough, it will develops some smaller node in the world, and covers themselves with a tough materials which blocks almost ammunitions, include RPG-7 rockets or high caliber armor- piercing bullets. These nodes can be detected with heartbeats from far \"}"
							"{\"text\":\"aways inside infested land, and serve as localized brain for the Gravemind. If Node shell is broken, it will self - recover. If the node is removed, the whole node structure will degenerared.\\n-Mature stage:\\n If Sculk Spore is infected in a vast area, they will enter \"}"
							"{\"text\":\"mature state, and infectors will stronger and deadlier, and more nodes will appears.\\n Sculk Enderman, was the deadliest enemy of the Sculk Horde. It have a lot of combat tactic. If it found a non-infector, Sculk Enderman will gathers infector, and use sculk tendrills to \"}"
							"{\"text\":\"attack. Also, Sculk Enderman release some spikes which levitate foe, and cast a sonic-boom like the Warden. The only thing to deal with it is sniper rifles with high-caliber bullets or machine guns for supress firearm.\"}"
						]
						resolved: 1b
						title: "研究日志 第344号"
					}
				}
				match_nbt: true
				title: "{ftbquests.chapter.side_quest_sculk_horde.quest4.task_4257024486006231379.title}"
				type: "item"
			}]
